(7696659, 1262362, 2158, '<td valign="top">Not everyday <u>for me</u> because most people here haven''t been vaccinated yet and we''re in a dreadful third wave of Covid right now. But I love this photo. It fills me with longing for the days when I can perceive scenes like this as everyday again.</td>', 'Not everyday for me because most people here haven''t been vaccinated yet and we''re in a dreadful third wave of Covid right now. But I love this photo. It fills me with longing for the days when I can perceive scenes like this as everyday again.', '2021-06-27 11:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7696678, 1262179, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Top 3.</td>', 'Beautiful! Top 3.', '2021-06-28 00:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7696679, 1262310, 173844, '<td valign="top">A beautiful June evening (I''m guessing), could it get any better?  Yes, it can be adorned by a filigree of vines and leaves standing out against the retreating light.  The softness of the background is the perfect murmur for this enchanting shot.  The sweetness of time passing.<br/>Top four.</td>', 'A beautiful June evening (I''m guessing), could it get any better?  Yes, it can be adorned by a filigree of vines and leaves standing out against the retreating light.  The softness of the background is the perfect murmur for this enchanting shot.  The sweetness of time passing.Top four.', '2021-06-28 00:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7696680, 1262323, 173844, '<td valign="top">Come close and partake in the mystery. There''s something ceremonial about this image, ritualistic.  That smattering of yellow-green on the lapis lazuli ironwork.  Sinking deeper and deeper, I submit.<br/>Top four.</td>', 'Come close and partake in the mystery. There''s something ceremonial about this image, ritualistic.  That smattering of yellow-green on the lapis lazuli ironwork.  Sinking deeper and deeper, I submit.Top four.', '2021-06-28 00:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7696681, 1262321, 173844, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely, the colors, the fading symmetry, gentle curves.  Terrific title.  I usually think of wabi sabi on a small scale, yet what''s more wonderful than looking up into the sky, an so this too enchants.  I also like how the complexity of the foreground sets off the structures and the blue-yellow background.<br/>Top four.</td>', 'Absolutely lovely, the colors, the fading symmetry, gentle curves.  Terrific title.  I usually think of wabi sabi on a small scale, yet what''s more wonderful than looking up into the sky, an so this too enchants.  I also like how the complexity of the foreground sets off the structures and the blue-yellow background.Top four.', '2021-06-28 00:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7696682, 1262347, 173844, '<td valign="top">It looks like some vegetation in front of a sun-drenched window shade.  It''s quite beautiful, like an animated Chinese character.  Great title, as it so seems.  As well as appearing brash, it''s also delicate and subtle.  The deep colors, and their dappled mood, are stirring.  Wonderfully mysterious.<br/>Top four.</td>', 'It looks like some vegetation in front of a sun-drenched window shade.  It''s quite beautiful, like an animated Chinese character.  Great title, as it so seems.  As well as appearing brash, it''s also delicate and subtle.  The deep colors, and their dappled mood, are stirring.  Wonderfully mysterious.Top four.', '2021-06-28 00:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
